---
---
<section class="section-final-solutions" id="inquiry">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fs-wrapper">
      
      <div class="fs-header">
        <span class="fs-eyebrow">Provocarea dumneavoastră</span>
        <h2 class="fs-title">
          Ce proces consumă astăzi timp inutil sau vă îngreunează munca?
        </h2>
        <p class="fs-desc">
          Descrieți procesul actual, persoanele sau sistemele implicate și ce doriți să îmbunătățiți. Nu aveți nevoie de un concept tehnic gata pregătit.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="fs-action-area">
        <div class="intake-visual">
          <div class="intake-line"></div>
          <div class="intake-line"></div>
          <div class="intake-line short"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="fs-cta-group">
          <a href="/contact/" class="fs-cta-btn">
            Descrieți provocarea
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          
          <div class="fs-reassurance">
            <img src="/images/gabriel-antonio-pop.png" alt="Gabriel Pop" class="fs-avatar">
            <span>Gabriel Pop vă va răspunde personal.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-final-solutions {
    padding: 8rem 0 10rem;
    background: var(--bg-page);
  }

  .fs-wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding: 6rem 5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  /* Decorative corner accent */
  .fs-wrapper::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 60px; height: 60px;
    background: var(--brand-purple-soft);
    clip-path: polygon(100% 0, 0 0, 100% 100%);
  }

  .fs-header {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .fs-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--brand-purple);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .fs-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .fs-desc {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .fs-action-area {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  /* Stylized text area prompt */
  .intake-visual {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    cursor: text;
  }
  .intake-line {
    height: 12px;
    background: #e2e8f0;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .intake-line.short {
    width: 60%;
  }

  .fs-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .fs-cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }
  .fs-cta-btn:hover {
    background: #0f1b30;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .fs-cta-btn svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .fs-cta-btn:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .fs-reassurance {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .fs-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .fs-wrapper {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }
    .fs-cta-group {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .fs-cta-btn {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .fs-reassurance {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>

